{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to a Doomed World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a cruel and unforgiving world, try to survive the freezing storms and the creatures born from your worst nightmares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dare to face the Shadows... and bring back the light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or in online co-op and experience a unique journey thanks to procedural generation, making every run different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But above all, listen to the breath of the wind, the long sigh of the night... and the Whisper of the Swallows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A harsh, procedurally generated world, structured in regions that you can influence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extreme weather events requiring careful planning and smart use of natural shelters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join your Steam friends \u2014 up to 6 players \u2014 and face the darkness together in co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build shelters and structures to protect yourself, stay organized, and prepare your expeditions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress your skills based on your actions and personal playstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep crafting: create and upgrade gear that matches your ambitions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill-based combat where timing your blocks and dodges can mean the difference between life and death</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Blown Leaves</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blown Leaves is an independent game studio based near Lille, in the north of France.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To contact us: <i>contact@blownleaves.fr</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2496090?t=1756918696","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.co